      "title": "Restrictable SSM actions apply to all resources",
      "resource": "aws_iam_policy.privesc-ssmStartSession-policy",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "explanation": "The policy grants StartSession and session-management actions against "*", allowing sessions to be started on any accessible managed instance and existing sessions to be manipulated without resource-level restrictions."
